                                        "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                        "entry_id": "76ec1bf5-b703-3ae5-81ac-6476d94fba77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exceptionally handsome man, having an even higher level of attractiveness than a Chad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6563604-723d-42fa-8d9c-70963e3bc8d5",
                                                "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                                "text": "if you were a foid with the infinite SMV [Sexual market value] that having eggs grants, and every guy on the planet wanted to fuck you, and getting fucked by chads is the biggest source of happiness chemicals possible, wouldn’t you also get fucked by gigachads all day long?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21c57269-3a54-4b9f-9b2d-ae2d34ae0dd4",
                                                "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                                "text": "Coordinate term: gigastacy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9134f0b-7d73-4b5f-910d-74f1c284aa29",
                                                "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                                "text": "How can I compete when I get mogged by gigachads as soon as I step outside?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9be2113-c29a-4b0c-8ac2-05d1ff4f0fa9",
                                                "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                                "text": ">wearing raybans cause its a private wealthyfag school\n >looks are on GigaChad level\n >bitch is mirin"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17e8b018-f9ff-484e-9d03-248519c161ff",
                                                "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                                "text": "A forum commenter applied this definition to a woman he saw on social media, \"…the foid [woman] had all the gigastacy [rated 10 on the scale] traits, she was hot, blonde, wore makeup, wears skimpy clothes, popular, parties, and her boyfriend is a muscular bodybuilder gigachad.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad52c3e7-cae4-4ce8-acc6-98dbfe59bc00",
                                                "sense_id": "2694616b-e203-343e-869d-071a62b0e39d",
                                                "text": "Those that land in the top 20 percent of the scale earn some variant of “Chad” as a designation, varying from the low-tier \"Chadlites\" to the ultimate \"Gigachad.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3452e772-2dc2-32cc-bb8f-15e0ecff58fe",
                                        "entry_id": "76ec1bf5-b703-3ae5-81ac-6476d94fba77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extremely admirable man; a Chad among Chads."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "broadly",
                                            "sarcastic",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3206ff44-d6b3-4fd4-96fc-943d40e9e0de",
                                                "sense_id": "3452e772-2dc2-32cc-bb8f-15e0ecff58fe",
                                                "text": "I heard Robert just donated $500 to Team Trees. What an absolute gigachad!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fa60ca0-e679-48f9-a514-50686c5db375",
                                                "sense_id": "3452e772-2dc2-32cc-bb8f-15e0ecff58fe",
                                                "text": "I have a lot of respect to Tarik for being a gigachad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89e05010-a862-48c9-ba62-57689e992cbc",
                                                "sense_id": "3452e772-2dc2-32cc-bb8f-15e0ecff58fe",
                                                "text": "As per his IGN interview, LMSH took 242 tries to beat Malenia on his own. After this, he just decided that no other player has to suffer the same fate he did. What an absolute GigaChad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52625809-f399-4307-8d37-73c642d56ae0",
                                                "sense_id": "3452e772-2dc2-32cc-bb8f-15e0ecff58fe",
                                                "text": "His meteoric rise from ironic gigachad to actual gigachad is a huge story in Counter-Strike: Global Offensive, but he just one-upped his own reputation. In an RMR match against Ecstatic, HooXi scored an insane HLTV rating of 2.21."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
